# Future Jarvis Rule

- Extend Digital Me; do not rewrite it as a greenfield assistant.
- Use specialized models for perception and deterministic code for safety/permissions.
- Use the LLM for reasoning/planning/synthesis, not every frame/event.
- New capabilities should emit/consume structured events and remain replaceable.
- CCTV MVP is local, one-camera-first, detection/tracking/zone/event based.
- Report observable behavior; do not infer criminal intent from appearance or closed packages.
- Autonomous developer work must be sandboxed away from live Discord/CCTV actions and must not push or perform destructive operations by default.
